# Trading Bot Project Structure

## Project Overview

This is a comprehensive algorithmic trading bot built with Python 3.14, featuring free-threading (no GIL), cryptocurrency trading via CCXT, advanced backtesting with Backtrader/VectorBT, and technical analysis with TA-Lib.

## Key Entry Points

- **CLI**: [src/trading_bot/cli.py](mdc:src/trading_bot/cli.py) - Command-line interface using Click
- **TUI**: [src/trading_bot/tui.py](mdc:src/trading_bot/tui.py) - Text User Interface using Textual
- **Main Bot**: [src/trading_bot/bot.py](mdc:src/trading_bot/bot.py) - Main orchestrator class
- **Configuration**: [src/trading_bot/config.py](mdc:src/trading_bot/config.py) - Configuration management with Pydantic

## Project Structure

```
TradingBOT/
├── src/trading_bot/          # Main package
│   ├── data/                 # Data fetching modules
│   │   ├── fetcher.py        # yfinance data fetcher (stocks)
│   │   ├── ccxt_fetcher.py   # CCXT data fetcher (crypto)
│   │   └── websocket_fetcher.py  # WebSocket real-time streaming
│   ├── strategies/           # Trading strategies
│   │   ├── base.py           # Base strategy class
│   │   ├── moving_average.py # Simple MA crossover
│   │   ├── ta_lib_strategy.py # TA-Lib strategies
│   │   ├── advanced_indicators.py # Supertrend, Bollinger, Ichimoku
│   │   └── ml_strategy.py    # Machine learning strategies
│   ├── backtesting/          # Backtesting engines
│   │   ├── engine.py         # Custom backtesting engine
│   │   ├── backtrader_engine.py # Backtrader integration
│   │   └── vectorbt_engine.py # VectorBT integration (10-100x faster)
│   ├── broker/               # Broker interfaces
│   │   ├── base.py           # Base broker interface
│   │   ├── paper.py          # Paper trading broker
│   │   └── ccxt_broker.py    # CCXT cryptocurrency broker
│   ├── risk/                 # Risk management
│   │   └── kelly_criterion.py # Kelly Criterion position sizing
│   ├── utils/                # Utilities
│   │   ├── logging.py        # Logging utilities
│   │   ├── multithreading.py # Python 3.14 multi-threading utilities
│   │   └── visualization.py # Visualization utilities
│   ├── orchestrator.py       # Multi-strategy orchestration
│   ├── bot.py                # Main bot orchestrator
│   ├── cli.py                # Command-line interface
│   ├── tui.py                # Text User Interface
│   └── config.py             # Configuration management
├── data/                     # Cached market data
├── logs/                     # Log files
├── results/                  # Backtest results
└── docs/                     # Documentation
    └── @docs/                # Summary and planning documents
```

## Package Management

- **Package Manager**: UV (not pip)
- **Python Version**: 3.14+ (requires free-threading)
- **Build Backend**: uv_build
- **Configuration**: [pyproject.toml](mdc:pyproject.toml)

## Key Dependencies

- **CCXT**: Cryptocurrency exchange integration
- **Backtrader**: Professional backtesting framework
- **VectorBT**: Ultra-fast vectorized backtesting (optional)
- **TA-Lib**: Technical analysis indicators (optional)
- **Textual**: TUI framework
- **Rich**: Terminal formatting
- **Pydantic**: Data validation and settings
